---
/* Made your way: custom orders. */
---

<section class="section section--white" id="custom">
    <div class="container split split--media-second">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Made your way</span>
        <h2>Tell us the look. We'll build it.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">Nothing here is mass produced. Every piece is cut, framed and upholstered to order — so you get furniture that fits your room, your colours and the way your family actually lives.</p>
        <ul class="tick-list" style="margin-top:30px">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Any colour or size</b> — bring a paint sample or a photo, we'll match it</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Boucle, corduroy, floral or leather</b> — we'll send fabric options to your phone</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Sofas, wardrobes, tables and full sets</b> — HDF and MDF builds available</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Most builds ready in 5–10 working days</b></span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:32px">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like a custom piece. Here is what I have in mind: ">Start a custom order</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="shop.html">Browse pieces</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame media-frame--tall reveal" data-delay="1">
        <img src="assets/img/opt/atelier.jpg" srcset="assets/img/opt/atelier-800.jpg 800w, assets/img/opt/atelier.jpg 1400w" sizes="(min-width:860px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="Chocolate brown sofa on the timber floor of the open-air That Furniture Girl workshop" width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy">
        <div class="media-badge"><strong>Hand-finished</strong><span>In our Ibadan workshop</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- process ------------------------------------------------------------ -->
